00:09:54.639 --> 00:10:01.420
the money at all money helps money can
make things grander or bigger or

00:10:01.420 --> 00:10:08.139
whatever but when it really comes down
to telling like a human story it you

00:10:08.139 --> 00:10:22.209
really don't need a lot to do that you
know and yeah that's what it taught I'm

00:10:22.209 --> 00:10:24.730
sure it wasn't
excellent at the time but yeah that's

